 <h3><u>Nanhe mujahid ran me jaaker</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haa..n haa...n<br> Shaah to aae jaane madar<br> tum nahi aae<br> nanhe mujahid ran me jakar<br> tum nahi aaye</p> 
  <p>1. Kabse khadi hu khaime ke dar par..(2)<br> aankho me lekar ashko ke sagar..(2)<br> pesh karu aajao jo asghar..(2)<br> tum nahi aae</p> 
  <p>2. Khali jo pehlu paungi beta..(2)<br> ghum se phatega mera kaleja..(2)<br> raat bhi guzregi ro ro kar..(2)<br> tum nahi aae</p> 
  <p>3. Raat andheri dashte bayabaa..(2)<br> darr nahi jana ran me meri jaa..(2)<br> kaise rahoge maa se bichad kar..(2)<br> tum nahi aae</p> 
  <p>4. Tumne isharo me ye kaha tha..(2)<br> dedo raza maqtal ki khudara..(2)<br> fatha mai karke aaunga lashkar..(2)<br> tum nahi aae</p> 
  <p>5. Haste hue khaimo se sidhare..(2)<br> peshe nazar hai saare nazare..(2)<br> sogaye kya maidaan me jakar..(2)<br> tum nahi aae</p> 
  <p>6. Teer laga hai kya gardan par..(2)<br> jo nahi dekha maa ko palatkar..(2)<br> kaunsi majburi thi asghar..(2)<br> tum nahi aae</p> 
  <p>7. Kisko sunaungi mai kahani..(2)<br> ye bhi na socha yusuf e saani..(2)<br> maa se kategi raat ye kyu kar..(2)<br> tum nahi aae</p> 
  <p>8. Kisne anees e ghum ko pukara..(2)<br> sunwao awaaz dobara..(2)<br> nauha yahi tha bano ke lab par..(2)<br> tum nahi aae</p> 
